            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Realtime Companion 0.1.134</h2><ul><li>Reconciles durable Work tasks periodically and after Companion reconnects.</li><li>Recovers returned files and available OpenClaw or Hermes reply previews instead of replacing them with generic restart results.</li><li>Keeps outcome-unknown work visible for confirmation rather than falsely marking it failed.</li><li>Preserves newer or malformed task stores unchanged instead of silently resetting them.</li></ul>
]]></description>
